From abf9a7d01d488a5fe283918343b7866cab901fe5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arie Brown <abrown@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2020 11:47:57 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-16001] fit: verify config node signature

switching from verify image to verify signature. by that we can
cover properites and several images in one signature.
for that the api of sha and rsa module had to be updated for using
regions.

Change-Id: I351cb17d3e13402e4d81610397fdc9b97d1cd2ab
Signed-off-by: Arie Brown <abrown@habana.ai>
---

